[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13020.19, "timestamp": "03:37:00", "text": "我的烧瓶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13023.429, "timestamp": "03:37:03", "text": "结束了。我得回忆一下。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13025.75, "timestamp": "03:37:05", "text": "呃，晚上好，对吧？所以，我去做一些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13028.19, "timestamp": "03:37:08", "text": "茶之类的东西。所以，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13057.03, "timestamp": "03:37:37", "text": "我被加进了一个讨论区，我被邀请参加了一个活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13060.15, "timestamp": "03:37:40", "text": "今天，一位更知名的创作者创建了一个 Discord 服务器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13062.71, "timestamp": "03:37:42", "text": "他们确实要求找类似的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13064.55, "timestamp": "03:37:44", "text": "比如他们是否感兴趣之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13066.87, "timestamp": "03:37:46", "text": "所以，我可能得接受一番“洗礼”之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13068.95, "timestamp": "03:37:48", "text": "那些东西。所以我正在考虑挂起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13071.429, "timestamp": "03:37:51", "text": "今天出去待一会儿，看看情况如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13074.67, "timestamp": "03:37:54", "text": "万物皆有其存在。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13078.429, "timestamp": "03:37:58", "text": "嗯，我先回答一下。感谢"}]